1-16T07:09:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9345632791519165,"text_excerpt":"This place is a huge resource for all of your wine and champagne needs in a large range of prices to fit everyone. There is plenty of parking in the private lot out front. There was a yelp check in offer of 10% off my order that I of course forgot to use but, oh well. The interior of the store had a mural of information on wine and it was pretty interesting. The lady working was very helpful in selecting things that we were looking for in our price range. She told us about their newsletter, upcoming tastings and that they will delivery for a flat delivery fee. This is great to know for the next time that I come to the city. I can have my wine ordered and ready to delivery or pick up befor..."},{"business_id":"4k-XUWBbeDyxjWdUrEsvLQ","review_id":"bSiSHPPfz1xfz6GB2h9fQg","date":"2019-11-23T17:14:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9287054538726807,"text_excerpt":"This is one of my favorite go to spots in the city especially if you are looking to have the ultimate shopping experience when you are viewing the large selection of spirits they have to offer. Plenty of parking in front of the store and also plenty of parking under the overpass bridge. The whole atmosphere of the inside is so welcoming and warm and beautifully laid out with some fun entertain where you can play some game systems to pass some time. You they have plenty of wine on tap. I do love this place as it can be a low key date spot. Every Thursday they have a free wine tasting from 6-8pm in which you get to sample up to about 5 or 6 wines based off what the server who usually is Rac..."},{"business_id":"4k-XUWBbeDyxjWdUrEsvLQ","review_id":"NEGREYlsJ0NSIoSSs0qQQA","date":"2019-08-16T23:01:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9261719584465027,"text_excerpt":"My fiancée and I came here Thursday evening to get some wine for the night and stumbled upon them having a free wine tasting from 6-8. They have a great selection and a wonderful staff! I will be back again!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4k-XUWBbeDyxjWdUrEsvLQ","photo_id":"D43l0IBaYgLhPvDzm8ZhiQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/D43l0IBaYgLhPvDzm8ZhiQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9177490472793579},{"business_id":"4k-XUWBbeDyxjWdUrEsvLQ","photo_id":"E7n-bGMdE2n2n5VcgQOjtA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/E7n-bGMdE2n2n5VcgQOjtA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8842669129371643},{"business_id":"4k-XUWBbeDyxjWdUrEsvLQ","photo_id":"UI9fEPn9gLAGAzJWfgYrPA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UI9fEPn9gLAGAzJWfgYrPA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8775166273117065},{"business_id":"4k-XUWBbeDyxjWdUrEsvLQ","photo_id":"X-_8EwHUe8jofVrM92TGdw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/X-_8EwHUe8jofVrM92TGdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8679073452949524}]},"notebook_case":null}
